"Dragon Rabbit is a Rabbit on Anesidora who runs an errand service that gets anything, anytime."
"His ads show a dragon with bunny ears on a hoard, and he delivers by drone."
"He bought Alden Thorn a full wardrobe for a thousand Argold, delivered in about two hours."
"He is faceless and nameless, reached only by voice call, and loves Spree days."
